    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Campbells Auctioneers are delighted to present this spacious family home to the open market, located in the peaceful rural townland of Ballynacarrick, Doochary, Co. Donegal.\n\nOccupying a site extending to approximately 0.49 Acres, this well-maintained property offers bright, spacious accommodation throughout and would make an ideal permanent residence or holiday home.\n\nThe property enjoys a tranquil countryside setting while remaining conveniently located just a few minutes` drive from the village of Lettermacaward, with the larger town of Dungloe only a short drive away, offering a wide range of shops, schools, restaurants, and local amenities.\n\nThe ground floor accommodation comprises a Fully Fitted Kitchen / Dining Area, a bright and spacious Living Room / Sun Room, a Family Bathroom, and Three Generously Proportioned Bedrooms, one of which benefits from an En Suite.\n\nThe first floor comprises Two Additional Spacious Bedrooms together with an Upstairs Bathroom, providing ample accommodation for larger families or visiting guests.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from a Detached Garage suitable for a variety of uses, together with a generous garden area offering excellent outdoor space.\n\nViewing is highly recommended and is by Strict Appointment with Campbells Auctioneers.\n\nOur Ref: K1267"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Kitchen - 4.3m (14'1\") x 4.12m (13'6\")\nFully Fitted Units, Linoleum Floor\n\nLiving / Sun Room - 7.46m (24'6\") x 4.86m (15'11\")\nLaminate Wood & Linoleum Floor\n\nOffice - 2.93m (9'7\") x 2.54m (8'4\")\nLaminate Wood Floor\n\nBathroom - 2.94m (9'8\") x 1.9m (6'3\")\nLinoleum, Shower, Bath(Tiled), Hand Basin, Toilet\n\nHallway - 5.95m (19'6\") x 1.91m (6'3\")\nLaminate Wood Flloor\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.11m (13'6\") x 2.76m (9'1\")\nLaminate Wood Floor\n\nBedroom 2 (En Suite) - 4.29m (14'1\") x 3.84m (12'7\")\nLaminate Wood Floor\n\nEn Suite (Bed 2) - 3.78m (12'5\") x 0.9m (2'11\")\nLinoleum Floor, Shower, Hand Basin, Toilet\n\nLanding - 4.47m (14'8\") x 2.83m (9'3\")\nCarpeted\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.89m (16'1\") x 4.48m (14'8\")\nCarpeted\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.46m (14'8\") x 3.91m (12'10\")\nCarpeted\n\nUpstairs Bathroom - 2.24m (7'4\") x 1.83m (6'0\")\nLinoleum Floor, Shower(Tiled), Hand Basin, Toilet\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
